{"ticker":{"symbol":"4264.T","name":"SECURE INC","market":"JP","exchange":""},"currency":"JPY","price":1036.0,"change_pct":-0.10380622837370246,"market_cap":6438773248.0,"pe":29.166666,"pb":1.5951223,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":1002.0,"week52_high":1989.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Security & Protection Services","country":"Japan","city":"Shinjuku","employees":199,"website":"https://www.secureinc.co.jp","business_summary":"Secure, Inc. engages in the security solution business in Japan. The company provides access control systems, such as card readers, fingerprint and facial recognition for offices, stores, factories, etc.; surveillance camera systems, that comprises various devices with AI and image recognition applications, including face recognition; and image analysis solutions that analyzes and predicts the degree of congestion in commercial facilities, event venues, evacuation centers, etc. It engages in research, development, and sales of artificial intelligence, cloud systems, and IoT devices. The company was incorporated in 2002 and is headquartered in Shinjuku, Japan.","business_summary_ko":"Secure, Inc.는 일본에서 보안 솔루션 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 회사는 사무실, 상점, 공장 등에 카드 판독기, 지문 및 얼굴 인식과 같은 출입 통제 시스템을 제공합니다. 얼굴 인식을 포함한 AI 및 이미지 인식 애플리케이션을 갖춘 다양한 장치로 구성된 감시 카메라 시스템; 상업시설, 행사장, 대피소 등의 혼잡도를 분석하고 예측하는 영상분석 솔루션 등을 개발하고 있습니다. 인공지능, 클라우드 시스템, IoT 디바이스 등을 연구, 개발, 판매하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 2002년에 설립되었으며 일본 신주쿠에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":9200000000.0,"rev_lo":9200000000.0,"rev_hi":9200000000.0,"rev_g":0.4659,"n":1,"eps":32.2,"eps_lo":32.2,"eps_hi":32.2,"eps_g":-0.1224},{"period":"2027","rev":11300000000.0,"rev_lo":11300000000.0,"rev_hi":11300000000.0,"rev_g":0.2283,"n":1,"eps":112.6,"eps_lo":112.6,"eps_hi":112.6,"eps_g":2.4969}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"보안 서비스","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":3384508000.0,"operating_income":-169597000.0,"net_income":-227627000.0,"eps":-48.52},{"period":"2023","revenue":5191074000.0,"o